# Overrides for CI artifacts that are intentionally anonymized or expected
# Build systems in CI sometimes set Changed-By to nobody@nowhere — accept it
bogus-mail-host

# Changelog entries in CI may be 'UNRELEASED' but .changes is for bullseye
# and we can't control CI distribution, accept the mismatch
changelog-distribution-does-not-match-changes-file

# The changes file can also have a bogus mail host which should be allowed
bogus-mail-host-in-debian-changelog
